---
import pkg from "../../../package.json";
---
<section class="block" aria-labelledby="h-integrations">
  <h2 class="display" id="h-integrations">Use it where you work.</h2>
  <div class="cols">
    <div class="prose">
      <p>OpenTeleport {pkg.version} includes a local MCP server and a Claude Code plugin. Preview a transfer, review what will change, then apply it from your session.</p>
      <p><a href="https://github.com/Open-Teleport/openteleport/blob/main/docs/integrations/mcp.md">Set up MCP and Claude Code</a></p>
    </div>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>Source plugins add native commands to OpenClaw and Hermes. Install them from the repository; they are separate from the npm CLI installation.</p>
      <p><a href="https://github.com/Open-Teleport/openteleport/blob/main/docs/integrations/native-plugins.md">Set up native plugins</a></p>
      <p><a href="https://github.com/Open-Teleport/openteleport/blob/main/docs/STATUS.md">Read verification status and current limits</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
